							<div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
								<p>
									Led large achievement gains in elementary school turnaround environment (95th
									percentile value-added scores). Selected as regional winner of the Excellence in
									Teaching Award.
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

